          "line": 2,
          "text": "-- merge): boss crowd-control immunities and health true to Ascension's logs."
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "text": "-- The three bosses take the crowd-control immunities of the other rank 3 dungeon bosses (charm, fear, polymorph, root,"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "text": "-- silence, sleep, stun and the rest of set -273, as Mograine, Whitemane or Ironaya)."
