        {
          "line": 1,
          "text": "-- Vaults of the Inquisition (map 936) and Road to De Other Side (map 937): Fierce Blow (975011, 100 % weapon damage)"
        },
        {
          "line": 2,
          "text": "-- hits as hard as the caster's regular blow. As a spell it took DestinyWeaver's flat damage factor instead of the"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "text": "-- weapon range a regular blow is mapped to, so below level 60 it hit for half a blow or less. The script only acts"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "text": "-- on these two maps."
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "text": "DELETE FROM `spell_script_names` WHERE `spell_id` = 975011 AND `ScriptName` = 'spell_coa_custom_dungeon_fierce_blow';"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
